# GCP-0007: Service account is granted a privileged role
#   False positive - Trivy's isRolePrivileged() flags roles/owner, roles/editor,
#   or ANY role ending in "admin" (case-insensitive), regardless of actual scope.
#   roles/gkehub.gatewayAdmin (granted to github-deployer in iam-kms/kms_iam.tf)
#   only grants Connect Gateway access (kubectl through the fleet gateway), not
#   general GCP administrative capability - it is Google's documented, required
#   role for this purpose and no lesser predefined role exists that still permits
#   kubectl apply through the gateway. Same class of false positive as Checkov's
#   CKV_GCP_42 on the *.editor-suffixed roles granted to the same service account.
AVD-GCP-0007
